      608        v-ord-oobj AT ROW 4.96 COL 6.63 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 20
      609        v-ord-op AT ROW 5.92 COL 6.63 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 38
      610        v-ord-min-ost-day AT ROW 6.88 COL 6.63 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 56
      611        v-ord-askp AT ROW 7.88 COL 9.63 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 62
      612        ord-obj-rc AT ROW 9.04 COL 7.63 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 70
      613        v-ord-obj-rc AT ROW 9.04 COL 23.63 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 68
      614        v-ordshipd AT ROW 10.21 COL 8.63 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 82
      615        v-ordcyclg AT ROW 11.21 COL 6.63 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 90
      616        v-ord-wgt-div-prc AT ROW 12.29 COL 12.25 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 96
      617        v-ord-11 AT ROW 13.5 COL 9.38 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 106
      618        v-ord-comp-prc AT ROW 14.71 COL 12.25 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 114
      619        I-ord-log AT ROW 3 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 10
      620        I-ord-ofof AT ROW 3.96 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 34
      621        I-ord-oobj AT ROW 4.96 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 36
      622        I-ord-op AT ROW 5.92 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 40
      623        I-ord-min-ost-day AT ROW 6.88 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 52
      624        I-ord-askp AT ROW 7.88 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 58
      625        I-ord-obj-rc AT ROW 9.04 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 64
      626        I-ordshipd AT ROW 10.21 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 78
      627        I-ordcyclg AT ROW 11.21 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 86
      628        I-ord-wgt-div-prc AT ROW 12.29 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 92
      629        I-ord-11 AT ROW 13.5 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 102
      630        I-ord-comp-prc AT ROW 14.71 COL 1.63 WIDGET-ID 110
      631        SPACE(81.98) SKIP(3.45)
      632       WITH VIEW-AS DIALOG-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER
      633            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D  SCROLLABLE
      634            TITLE "Настройки для заказов"
      635            DEFAULT-BUTTON B-exit CANCEL-BUTTON B-quit WIDGET-ID 100.
      636   ASSIGN
      637          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      638          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      639   ASSIGN
      640          ord-obj-rc:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      641   ASSIGN
      642          v-ord-11:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      643   ASSIGN
      644          v-ord-askp:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      645   ASSIGN
      646          v-ord-comp-prc:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      647   ASSIGN
      648          v-ord-log:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      649   ASSIGN
      650          v-ord-min-ost-day:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      651   ASSIGN
      652          v-ord-obj-rc:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      653   ASSIGN
      654          v-ord-ofof:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      655   ASSIGN
      656          v-ord-oobj:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      657   ASSIGN
      658          v-ord-op:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      659   ASSIGN
      660          v-ord-wgt-div-prc:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      661   ASSIGN
      662          v-ordcyclg:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      663   ASSIGN
      664          v-ordshipd:READ-ONLY IN FRAME Dialog-Frame        = TRUE.
      665   ON GO OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
      666   DO:
      667     run save-proc in this-procedure no-error.
      668     if error-status :error then return no-apply.
      669   END.
      670   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
      671   DO:
      672     APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
      673   END.
      674   ON CHOOSE OF B-attr-ord-11 IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
      675   DO:
      676     run gbl/v-taobj.w
      677         ('ord-obj':U,
      678          'ord-11':U
      679          ).
      680   END.
      681   ON CHOOSE OF B-attr-ord-askp IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
      682   DO:
      683     run gbl/v-taobj.w
      684         ('ord-obj':U,
      685          'ord-askp':U
      686          ).
      687   END.
