      754     MESSAGE I-ord-min-ost-day:private-data  VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX INFORMATION.
      755   END.
      756   ON MOUSE-SELECT-CLICK OF I-ord-obj-rc IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
